@startuml

actor Student

participant "Assistant UI" as UI
participant "Backend API" as API
participant "AI Agent" as AGENT
participant "Moodle Connector" as MC
participant Moodle
participant "Context Builder" as CB
participant "Gemini API" as GEMINI
database "Assistant DB" as DB

Student -> UI : Ask question
UI -> API : Submit question

API -> AGENT : Process question

AGENT -> MC : Request assignments/deadlines
MC -> Moodle : Authenticated API request
Moodle --> MC : Assignment data

MC --> AGENT : Relevant Moodle data

AGENT -> CB : Build context
CB -> DB : Check cached data
DB --> CB : Context data

CB --> AGENT : Prepared context

AGENT -> GEMINI : Question + system prompt + context
GEMINI --> AGENT : Generated answer

AGENT -> DB : Store conversation
AGENT --> API : Final answer

API --> UI : Response
UI --> Student : Display answer

@enduml